@startuml state-outbox
title OWBS — Machine à états d'une row lead_event_outbox
skinparam shadowing false
[*] --> pending : enqueue (dans la txn métier)
pending --> processing : pickBatch (FOR UPDATE SKIP LOCKED)
processing --> done : handler OK
processing --> pending : échec retryable\n(attempts++, next_attempt_at = backoff)
pending --> dead : attempts > max_attempts
done --> [*]
dead --> [*] : alerte ops (à rejouer manuellement)

note bottom
  UNIQUE(type, leadId, dedupe_key) absorbe
  les doubles-insertions (idempotence des effets)
end note
@enduml
